cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenDSZ in your research, software, or projects, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: "Roy"
    given-names: "Abraham Jeevan"
    email: "abrahamjroy@gmail.com"
title: "OpenDSZ: Free & Open-Source DualSense Controller Manager"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-21
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://github.com/abrahamjroy/OpenDSZ"
repository-code: "https://github.com/abrahamjroy/OpenDSZ"
abstract: >-
  OpenDSZ is a lightweight, cross-platform DualSense and DualSense Edge controller
  manager providing adaptive trigger resistance, 6-axis air mouse navigation,
  tactile Force Touch haptics, UDP racing telemetry synthesis, and dynamic RGB
  lightbar effects across Windows, macOS, and Linux.
keywords:
  - dualsense
  - playstation
  - adaptive-triggers
  - haptic-feedback
  - telemetry
  - air-mouse
  - forza-horizon
  - gaming-controller
